-
-		tempsense:	(RO) Display temp sense registers in decimal
-
-		serial:		(RO) Serial number of the HCA
-
-		nfreectxts:	(RO) The number of free user ports (contexts)
-				available.
-
-		chip_reset:	(WO) Reset the chip if possible by writing
